	(text "USB2514 USB2 Hub"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 7.62 7.62)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "91bd37e3-c4d0-4bff-be45-476ebc3a186c")
	)
	(text "Notes:\n\n1.	We choose the M2 version (SQFN package) since the QFN versions are labeled legacy and not reccomended (source: datasheet)\n2.	BC_EN pins can be left unconnected since they have internal pull downs. This disables battery charging feature for all ports\n3.	~{OCS} pins are active low with internal pull up. Since we are not controlling any power circuits, we can leave them disconnected\n4.	This hub is powered from the battery and is thus self-powered.\n5.	CFG_SEL pins are set to {00}. Configuration straps are used to configure the hub instead of SMBUS\n6.	We only need 2 ports. Hence, we disable ports 2 and 3 by pulling both pins up to 3.3V through a 10k resistor\n7.	Power consumption on 3V3 rail (This estimate assumes all DFP are high speed devices)\n	-	Max: 85mA base + 25mA/ port * 2 = 145mA\n	-	Typical: 70mA base + 25mA/ port * 2 = 130mA\n8.	Crystal oscillator capacitance estimation\n	-	Load capacitance: 12pF\n	-	Estimated trace + pin capacitance: 3pF\n	-	C_1 = C_2 = 2 * (12 - 3) = 18pF\n9.	TLV803S power monitor reset toggle\n	-	A maximum 3V3 rise time of 400us is allowed\n	-	Since the 3V3 LDO we use has a soft-start time of 1ms, we use a TLV803S power monitor to toggle the N_RESET pin on the USB hub\n	-	The TLV803S has a threshold voltage of 2.93V.\n	-	~{RESET} is low-impedance and pulled to GND when the supply voltage first exceeds 1.1V.\n	-	After the supply voltage exceeds the threshold voltage of 2.93V for 200ms, ~{RESET} is high-impedance and the line is pulled up\n	-	~{RESET} is wired to the N_RESET pin of the USB2514. N_RESET is asserted when it is pulled low. When the 3V3 line is valid and ~{RESET} is high, the hub starts up\n10.	References:\n	-	https://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/aemDocuments/documents/OTH/ProductDocuments/BoardDesignFiles/EVB-USB2514B-FS_A1EvaluationBoardSchematicPDF.pdf"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.288 41.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b20d1b37-c335-4f0b-84a1-403313f16995")
	)
